DESCRIPTION:<p>Hi everyone\,</p><p>I’m excited to follow up on our partners
 hip with Dust! As a next step\, we are organizing a demo session this Thurs
 day\, October 23. This will be a great opportunity to see Dust in action an
 d explore how it can add value to our clients and teams. <b>We will have th
 e honor to welcome Philippe Rolet\, founding engineer (and co-founder of Ar
 tefact!)\, and Thibault Martin\, partnership lead.</b></p><p>Demo Details:<
 br></p><ul><li>Date: Thursday\, October 23</li><li>Format: Hybrid (in-perso
 n at Artefact Paris\, rue Richer\, or online)</li><li>Recording: The sessio
 n will be recorded for those who cannot attend live</li></ul>Why Attend?<br
 ><ul><li>Get a firsthand look at how Dust can empower business teams and un
 lock quick wins for our clients.</li><li>Learn how Artefact can leverage Du
 st to build conviction\, prepare for client needs\, and scale use cases eff
 ectively.</li><li>Ask questions and discuss potential business value with t
 he team.</li></ul>Looking forward to seeing you there!<p></p><p>Don’t hesit
 ate to reach out if you have any questions.</p><p>Kind regards\,</p><p>Aman
 dine</p>\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/ys
 q-dnsn-fyt\nOr dial: (FR) +33 1 87 40 27 09 PIN: 228149658#\nMore phone num
 bers: https://tel.meet/ysq-dnsn-fyt?pin=3632233766476&hs=7\n\nLearn more ab
 out Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\n\nPlease do
  not edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
