DESCRIPTION:Hello all !<br><br>Save the date for the upcoming <b>"AI &amp\;
  Art" exhibition !</b><br><br><b>What ? 🖼️🤖</b><br>Save the date for the 
 upcoming art exhibition "AI &amp\; Art" in our Paris office (19\, rue Riche
 r) where art pieces produced by Artefactors (paintings\, drawings\, live mu
 sic\, ...) will be exposed alongside their AI reinventions.<br><br><b>Who ?
  ✉️</b><br>All Artefactors &amp\; clients\, so don't hesitate to share this
  invitation with your current or past clients <br><br><b>Why ? 🎨</b><br>En
 joy amazing works of art (paintings\, photography\, music\, ...) created by
  Artefactors and discover how AI is about to change our perception and crea
 tive process.<br><br>We hope to see all of you for this unique event !<br><
 br>Artistically yours\,<br>AI &amp\; Art org Team\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin wit
 h Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/jnq-pxor-bpn\nOr dial: (US) +1 346-3
 14-0411 PIN: 374727567#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/jnq-pxor-bpn?
 pin=6893830828285&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.
 com/a/users/answer/9282720\n\nPlease do not edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::
