 iMjk3YmJmOGQ5@thread.v2&messageId=0&language=fr-FR>\nBy default\, only peop
 le who were invited to the meeting (directly or by forward) can join the me
 eting bypassing the lobby\n________________________________________________
 ________________________________\n
