 connu et de confiance\n\n\n\nHello Thomas!\n\nI hope you're doing well.\n\n
 I’m currently working on extracting data from a large set of PDF files (aro
 und 10 GB\, approximately 200\,000 files) into a structured tabular format 
 (Excel or CSV) using Palantir.\n\nSince each report may have a different la
 yout and structure\, I’ve been leveraging AI to identify and extract the re
 levant fields (at the moment I tested the pipeline on 30 files only).\nHowe
 ver\, I’m running into some challenges and would really appreciate your sup
 port or guidance on the best approach to handle this within Palantir.\n\nIn
  particular\, I’m wondering if I can upload these files directly into Palan
 tir\, or do I need to use an agent connection due to storage constraints?\n
 \nAnd is it feasible to use the AIP service for this volume of data\, or wo
 uld that be too much for the platform?\n\nCould we schedule a quick call or
  exchange some ideas on possible solutions?\n\nThank you in advance for you
 r help!\n\nBest regards\,\nDavide\n\n\n\nDavide Bocchia\n\nApplication Data
