DESCRIPTION:Hello Valentina and Davide\, I hope you are doing great\, I am 
 moving out of the group medical data project\, leaving the spotlight to Tho
 mas :) It’s been a pleasure working with you ! I hope that this project wil
 l continue to live and be beneficial to both our teams. I have to cancel th
 ose meetings\, for Thomas to schedule new ones. I hope you enjoyed your hol
 idays\, Tom\n\n________________________________\nHello Valentina & Andrea\,
 \nI hope you are doing well\,\n\nI suggest that we secure those slots to ca
 tch-up on the advancement of the Group medical data structuration projet\, 
 especially those 2 streams\n\n  *   Identification of the data to build the
  group medical KPIs\n  *   Automation of the data ingestion process\n\nHave
  a great day\,\nTom\n\n____________________________________________________
