DESCRIPTION:If you're in the London office\, please join in person. For tho
 se around the world\, please join online! The session is focusing on women'
 s productivity to celebrate International Women's Day. We'd love if you can
  join us :)<br><br><b>Agenda:</b><ol><li>Welcome &amp\; Icebreaker (5 mins)
 </li><li>Understanding the Hormonal Cycle &amp\; Productivity (10 mins)</li
 ><li>Women vs. Men: The Productivity Gap &amp\; Performance Differences (10
  mins)</li><li>Healthy Habits That Boost Productivity (10 mins)</li><li>Int
 eractive Wrap-Up: Takeaways &amp\; Actions (10 mins)</li></ol>\n\n-::~:~::~
