DESCRIPTION:Hi @Edmond\, Philippe<mailto:philippe.edmond@astrazeneca.com> a
 nd team\,\n\nAs we're reaching the end of the holiday season\, may I sugges
 t a weekly catch-up to assist with your migration to Power BI? This may inc
 lude help with technical blockers or design guidance (in French). Kind rega
 rds\, Nat\n\nAgenda\n\n  *   Discuss Power BI migration progress\n  *   Rev
 iew designs from the supplier\n  *   Plan next steps for the migration\n\nS
 ummarising the conversation so far:\nNat Van Gulck from Microsoft reached o
 ut to Philippe Edmond and the France team to offer assistance with their mi
 gration to Power BI after returning from annual leave. Previously\, a meeti
 ng was scheduled to review the supplier's designs for the Power BI data mod
 el\, but it was postponed because the designs were not ready.\n\n__________
 ______________________________________________________________________\nMic
 rosoft Teams Need help?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=en-GB>\nJoin t
 he meeting now<https://teams.microsoft.com/l/meetup-join/19%3ameeting_ZDk3Z
 mE4YmQtZjAzYy00Mjk2LWExNjYtMWQ4NWQzNGRkNjc3%40thread.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid
 %22%3a%2272f988bf-86f1-41af-91ab-2d7cd011db47%22%2c%22Oid%22%3a%220169796e-
 0444-4e3e-950b-711d386d647e%22%7d>\nMeeting ID: 370 310 987 443\nPasscode: 
 pzSWr7\n________________________________\nDial in by phone\n+44 20 3787 439
