DESCRIPTION:Hi All!<br><br>First of all\, I have to say that I'm really hap
 py to see this number of people Interested and already engaged with D&amp\;
 EI initiatives around the World ❤️🏳️‍🌈🏳️‍⚧️<br><br>I tried to find a tim
 e that would fit most of us\, but because we have people around the world\,
  maybe the time will not suit everyone. If this is really late for MENA or 
 any other Region\, please let us know so we can try to schedule a meeting j
 ust with the regions that are not able to join.<br><br><b>In this first mee
 ting\, we'll:</b><br><br>1. Share <b>Artefact Global Objectives for D&amp\;
 EI</b><br>2. Share the <b>Community Objectives\, Governance and Ways of Wor
 king</b><br>3. Understand the <b>Ambassador's Roles and Responsibilities</b
 ><br>4. Get to know everyone who will be participating in our Global D&amp\
 ;EI Community<br>5. Stat discussing Global &amp\; Regional possible initiat
 ives for this year<br>6. Align Next Steps and Owners<br><br>I'm already int
 erested to know what every Region is doing regarding D&amp\;EI and to get t
 o know you all!<br><br>See you soon!\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Google Meet
 : https://meet.google.com/cyw-obpx-cag\nOr dial: (BR) +55 51 4560-7739 PIN:
  162753335#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/cyw-obpx-cag?pin=93251636
 42330&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/
 answer/9282720\n\nPlease do not edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
