 d your work ethic and structuration of the project. I have to cancel those 
 meetings\, for Thomas to schedule new ones. I hope you enjoyed your holiday
 s\, Tom\n\n________________________________\nHello Maïk & Andreas\,\nI hope
  you are doing well\,\n\nI suggest that we secure those slots to catch-up o
 n the advancement of the Group medical data structuration projet\, especial
 ly those 2 streams\n\n  *   Identification of the data to build the group m
 edical KPIs\n  *   Automation of the data ingestion process\n\nHave a great
  day\,\nTom\n______________________________________________________________
