DESCRIPTION:<p>Dear Artefactors\,</p><p>We are thrilled to invite you to <b
 >an exclusive virtual talk with Aurélie Jean\, a renowned figure in the tec
 h world.</b></p><table><colgroup><col /></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p><b><i>
 Aurélie Jean\, celebrated for her expertise in data science\, computational
  modeling\, and her advocacy for women in tech\,</i></b><i> has captivated 
 audiences worldwide through her books\, keynote speeches\, and her recent p
 articipation in the TV show Loup Garou. Her career is an inspiring testamen
 t to the power of data to drive innovation and the importance of diversity 
 in technology.<br></i><b><br>This 30-minute informal exchange is your oppor
 tunity to engage directly with Aurélie. <br></b><span><br>Together\, we wil
 l explore:</span><span><br></span></p><ul><li><span>Her journey as a woman 
 breaking barriers in tech\,</span></li><li><span>The impact of her work on 
 inspiring the next generation of tech professionals\,</span></li><li><span>
 Insights from her experiences as an author\, speaker\, and media figure.</s
 pan></li></ul><b>The session will be conducted in English and is open to al
 l Artefact employees across our global offices.<br></b><span><br>Don’t miss
  this chance to be part of a conversation with one of the most influential 
 voices in tech today. We look forward to seeing you there!</span><p></p><p>
 <span>Warm regards\,<br></span><span>On behalf of the Women@Artefact Initia
 tive</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Google
  Meet: https://meet.google.com/krx-inin-uba\nOr dial: (FR) +33 1 87 40 38 5
 8 PIN: 578448414#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/krx-inin-uba?pin=40
 46679939071&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/
 users/answer/9282720\n\nPlease do not edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
