DESCRIPTION:Hello Miguel ! How are you ? I suggest we cancel those calls as
  Thomas is taking the lead on the medical KPIs project. I was very happy to
  work with you for this short time. All the best\, Tom\n\n_________________
 _______________\nHello Miguel\,\nI hope you are doing well\,\n\nI suggest t
 hat we secure those slots to catch-up on the advancement of the Group medic
 al data structuration projet\, especially those 2 streams\n\n  *   Identifi
 cation of the data to build the group medical KPIs\n  *   Automation of the
  data ingestion process\n\nHave a great day\,\nTom\n_______________________
 _________________________________________________________\nMicrosoft Teams 
 Besoin d'aide ?<https://aka.ms/JoinTeamsMeeting?omkt=fr-FR>\nRejoignez la r
