DESCRIPTION:Hello team\,<br><br>I hope you’re all having a great week!<br><
 br>Next week\, we’re officially kicking off the new semester. <br><br><u>He
 re is the agenda for our session:</u><br><ol><li><b>Mandates &amp\; Org: </
 b>We’ll align on who is owning what this semester.</li><li><b>Squad Objecti
 ves: </b>Setting the bar high for our S2 targets.</li><li><b>The Big Demo: 
 </b>We’ll be showing off the new agent we’ve developed to help centralize o
 ur one-pagers.</li></ol><br><br>Looking forward to seeing you all there and
  crushing our goals for the semester!<br><br>I promise this is actually wor
 th your precious calendar time (I’ve checked with my horoscope\, and it’s a
  surprisingly good day for synergy).<br><br>Best\,<br>Eugénie &amp\; Angeli
 ka.\n\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:
 ~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/jhx-hbj
 c-bss\nOr dial: (FR) +33 1 87 40 46 28 PIN: 647253546#\nMore phone numbers:
  https://tel.meet/jhx-hbjc-bss?pin=5021714547293&hs=7\n\nLearn more about M
 eet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\n\nPlease do not 
 edit this section.\n-::~:~::~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~
 :~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~:~::~:~::-
